Package: toyBioc
Title: Toy Package to Illustrate Bioconductor Package Development
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Fabrício", "Almeida-Silva", email = "fabricio@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: toyBioc is a minimal example package used in a talk about
    Bioconductor package development. It implements a single normalization
    function for RNA-seq count matrices. The package also shows how to store
    and document example data in inst/extdata and how to test functions.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
biocViews: Software, Normalization, RNASeq
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
